OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FSunshine to kick off the day
OL,6,Fbut soon turning cloudier as outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain push southwards across the
OL,8,Fregion. Temperatures below the
OL,9,Fseasonal average and the cool breeze
OL,10,Fcontinues.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FBecoming more settled with an
OL,14,Fincreasing number of sunny spells.
OL,15,FSmall chance of a shower on Saturday.
OL,16,FTemperatures below average for August
OL,17,Fbut feeling pleasant where the
OL,18,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
